# Fast, Docker-free typecheck before every push -- the full e2e suite now
# runs in CI on every PR/push to main (.github/workflows/e2e.yml), which has
# real network access and doesn't fight Docker registry/egress policies the
# way a local or sandboxed-agent environment can. Catches the same class of
# build-breaking type errors CI's typecheck job would, just before the push
# leaves your machine instead of a few minutes later in a red PR check.
#
# Still want the full local Cypress run against a real local Supabase before
# pushing (Docker required)? `npm run test:e2e:local` runs it directly.
# Skip this check entirely with `git push --no-verify` if you know what
# you're doing.
npm run preflight
